<scroll-view class="page guide-page" scroll-y type="list" scroll-into-view="{{scrollAnchor}}">
  <view class="guide-hero"><view class="guide-kicker">图研Tuyan GUIDE</view><view class="guide-hero-title">从方法文字到投稿图示</view><view class="guide-hero-note">小程序完整对齐线上工作台：服务端模型目录、十种比例、负向提示词、参考图库、任务记录和独立精修。</view><view class="guide-actions"><button class="guide-action" bindtap="goGenerate">开始生成</button><button class="guide-action secondary" bindtap="scrollToContact">联系作者</button></view></view>
  <view class="registry-card"><view class="registry-row"><text class="registry-label">Registry</text><view class="registry-value">{{registryVersion}}</view></view><view class="registry-row"><text class="registry-label">当前渠道</text><view class="registry-value">{{providerLabels}}</view></view><view class="registry-row"><text class="registry-label">百炼默认路线</text><view class="registry-value">{{defaultRoutes}}</view></view><view class="registry-error" wx:if="{{registryError}}">{{registryError}}</view></view>

  <view class="chapter-list">
    <view class="chapter" wx:for="{{chapters}}" wx:key="id">
      <view class="chapter-head" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="toggleChapter"><view><view class="chapter-title">{{index + 1}}. {{item.title}}</view><view class="chapter-summary">{{item.summary}}</view></view><view class="chapter-arrow">{{item.open ? '−' : '+'}}</view></view>
      <view class="chapter-body" wx:if="{{item.open}}">
        <block wx:if="{{item.id === 'quick'}}"><view class="step"><text class="step-number">1</text><view><view class="step-title">选模板和设置</view><view class="step-copy">从六套精选结构起步，确认渠道、三角色模型、比例、格式与清晰度。</view></view></view><view class="step"><text class="step-number">2</text><view><view class="step-title">写清研究内容</view><view class="step-copy">方法最多 12000 字，图注和负向提示词各最多 1000 字；上传参考图与图库检索二选一。</view></view></view><view class="step"><text class="step-number">3</text><view><view class="step-title">提交并查看演化</view><view class="step-copy">任务来源固定为 miniprogram，记录页会保留输入、模型路线、阶段、错误和 objectKey 资产。</view></view></view></block>
        <block wx:elif="{{item.id === 'settings'}}"><view class="setting-card" wx:for="{{settingCards}}" wx:key="name"><view class="setting-card-title">{{item.name}}</view><text class="setting-card-copy">{{item.description}}</text></view></block>
        <block wx:elif="{{item.id === 'models'}}"><view class="guide-copy">生产 registry 是模型、角色、权益、验证状态、比例和清晰度的唯一提交依据。页面先显示 API 渠道，再按模型厂商分组；不兼容模型保留可见并显示禁用原因。目录加载失败时仍可查看记录和教程，但新建、精修和 Ark 验证会关闭。</view><view class="guide-copy">“稳定”描述模型生命周期；“目录可见”不等于当前账号已能调用；Ark 的文本/视觉 probe 免费优先，图像 probe 可能计费，必须单独确认。</view></block>
        <block wx:elif="{{item.id === 'references'}}"><view class="guide-copy">参考图库使用 scope=bench、每页 12 项，支持关键词、视觉类别、研究领域和 diagram/plot 筛选。选择状态跨页保留，最多 10 项；旧查询响应不会覆盖新查询。</view><view class="guide-copy">上传参考图走 prepare → PUT → finalize，任一步失败都会 abort。上传成功后检索自动关闭，避免多个风格来源冲突。</view></block>
        <block wx:elif="{{item.id === 'refine'}}"><view class="guide-copy">“精修”是独立一级入口，来源可选本机任务或登录账号任务。新任务优先发送 sourceImageObjectKey；历史任务才使用受控签名 URL 兼容。</view><view class="guide-copy">direct-edit 只需要 image 路由；analyze-redraw 需要 vision + image。精修比例与清晰度分别读取 refineAspectRatios / refineResolutions。</view></block>
        <block wx:elif="{{item.id === 'records'}}"><view class="guide-copy">成功或失败任务都会显示方法、图注、负向提示词、来源端、显式路线、比例、阶段与可用资产。签名 URL 只负责预览，objectKey 才是长期资产身份。</view><view class="guide-copy">容量 429 请稍后重试；RUNTIME_RESTARTED_RETRY 需要重新提交；能力和比例错误会直接引导回对应设置。</view></block>
        <block wx:else><view class="guide-copy">BYOK API Key 只保存在当前页面内存，不写 Storage、日志或任务记录。记录页的“账户设置”支持退出、隐私说明与永久删除账号。</view><view class="guide-copy">删除必须显示并重输当前邮箱、重输密码并二次确认。成功后清理 Cookie、草稿、任务缓存和内存密钥。</view></block>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section contact-section" id="contact-section"><view class="guide-section-title">联系作者</view><view class="guide-copy">长按识别二维码，或直接提交意见反馈。</view><image class="contact-qr" src="{{qrSrc}}" mode="widthFix" show-menu-by-longpress="{{true}}" /><button class="secondary-button" bindtap="openFeedbackPanel">意见反馈</button></view>
  <view class="section about-section"><view class="guide-section-title">关于图研Tuyan</view><view class="about-row"><text class="about-label">客户端版本</text><text class="about-value">{{clientVersion}}</text></view><view class="about-row"><text class="about-label">网站端</text><button class="about-button" data-key="site" bindtap="copyLink">复制链接</button></view><view class="about-row"><text class="about-label">GitHub 仓库</text><button class="about-button" data-key="github" bindtap="copyLink">复制链接</button></view><view class="about-row"><text class="about-label">PaperBanana 论文</text><button class="about-button" data-key="paper" bindtap="copyLink">复制链接</button></view></view>
  <view class="footer-space"></view>
</scroll-view>
<feedback-panel show="{{showFeedbackPanel}}" bind:close="closeFeedbackPanel" />
